DSHMap.receive("pkg","@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-plugin-market-bundle",{"readme":"# @deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-plugin-market-bundle\n\nEnglish | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\n## Summary\n\nThis optional bundle mounts custom plugin markets: the Host [`pluginMarket`](../../boot/plugin-market/README.md) service, which reads the plugin market indexes the user adds, and the Web [Discover tab](../../client/ui-plugin-market/README.md) of the Plugins page. Shipped profiles leave it disabled.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Use this package](#use-this-package)\n- [Understand the implementation](#understand-the-implementation)\n- [Model Experience](#model-experience)\n- [Known Limitations and Deferred Work](#known-limitations-and-deferred-work)\n- [Dev Note](#dev-note)\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"use-this-package\"></a>\n## Use this package\n\nOpen **Plugins** in the Web sidebar, select **More** beside **Experimental plugins**, and switch on **Custom plugin markets**; once on, it also appears on the main list. The page then shows the **Installed** and **Discover** tabs; **Discover** adds index sources and installs their bundles. Switching the bundle off removes the Discover tab and the `plugin_market` tool; the saved index sources stay in the profile.\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"understand-the-implementation\"></a>\n## Understand the implementation\n\n<details>\n<summary>Maintainer details — click to expand</summary>\n\nThe static `cordis.patch.yml` inserts the `plugin-market` service row, disabled without a profile like `plugin-manager`, and the `ui-plugin-market` browser row. The Creator preset keeps its `tool-plugin-market` row; that plugin registers `plugin_market` only while `pluginMarket` is mounted, so the row neither waits nor shows the tool without this bundle. The Plugins page shows its tabs only when a `plugins.tab` entry exists, so it needs no knowledge of this bundle.\n\n</details>\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"model-experience\"></a>\n## Model Experience\n\nIndirectly, through the `pluginMarket` service: with the bundle switched on, the Creator preset gains the read-only `plugin_market` tool documented in [`dsh-plugin-market`](../../boot/plugin-market/README.md#model-experience).\n\n#### KV Cache effect\n\nSwitching the bundle on or off adds or removes one tool schema in Creator sessions, which changes the cached request prefix of later requests.\n\n## Known Limitations and Deferred Work\n\n<a id=\"known-limitations-and-deferred-work\"></a>\n\n- There is no official market; Discover lists only the index sources the user adds.\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"dev-note\"></a>\n### Dev Note\n\n<details>\n<summary>Maintainer details — click to expand</summary>\n\nNone.\n\n</details>\n","modelExperience":"Indirectly, through the `pluginMarket` service: with the bundle switched on, the Creator preset gains the read-only `plugin_market` tool documented in [`dsh-plugin-market`](../../boot/plugin-market/README.md#model-experience).\n\n#### KV Cache effect\n\nSwitching the bundle on or off adds or removes one tool schema in Creator sessions, which changes the cached request prefix of later requests.","limitations":"- There is no official market; Discover lists only the index sources the user adds.\n\n-----","files":[["README.i18n.yaml",34,1487,"o"],["README.md",68,2654,"o"],["README.zh.md",68,2521,"o"],["cordis.patch.yml",10,460,"o"],["icon.svg",9,895,"o"],["locale/en.json",6,181,"o"],["locale/zh.json",6,179,"o"],["package.json",50,1320,"o"],["src/index.ts",2,103,"s"],["tsconfig.json",15,227,"o"],["tsdown.config.ts",3,219,"o"]],"sources":{"README.md":"---\ndescription: \"Enable experimental custom plugin markets from the plugin manager.\"\nkind: \"package-bundle\"\n---\n\n# @deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-plugin-market-bundle\n\nEnglish | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\n## Summary\n\nThis optional bundle mounts custom plugin markets: the Host [`pluginMarket`](../../boot/plugin-market/README.md) service, which reads the plugin market indexes the user adds, and the Web [Discover tab](../../client/ui-plugin-market/README.md) of the Plugins page. Shipped profiles leave it disabled.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Use this package](#use-this-package)\n- [Understand the implementation](#understand-the-implementation)\n- [Model Experience](#model-experience)\n- [Known Limitations and Deferred Work](#known-limitations-and-deferred-work)\n- [Dev Note](#dev-note)\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"use-this-package\"></a>\n## Use this package\n\nOpen **Plugins** in the Web sidebar, select **More** beside **Experimental plugins**, and switch on **Custom plugin markets**; once on, it also appears on the main list. The page then shows the **Installed** and **Discover** tabs; **Discover** adds index sources and installs their bundles. Switching the bundle off removes the Discover tab and the `plugin_market` tool; the saved index sources stay in the profile.\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"understand-the-implementation\"></a>\n## Understand the implementation\n\n<details>\n<summary>Maintainer details — click to expand</summary>\n\nThe static `cordis.patch.yml` inserts the `plugin-market` service row, disabled without a profile like `plugin-manager`, and the `ui-plugin-market` browser row. The Creator preset keeps its `tool-plugin-market` row; that plugin registers `plugin_market` only while `pluginMarket` is mounted, so the row neither waits nor shows the tool without this bundle. The Plugins page shows its tabs only when a `plugins.tab` entry exists, so it needs no knowledge of this bundle.\n\n</details>\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"model-experience\"></a>\n## Model Experience\n\nIndirectly, through the `pluginMarket` service: with the bundle switched on, the Creator preset gains the read-only `plugin_market` tool documented in [`dsh-plugin-market`](../../boot/plugin-market/README.md#model-experience).\n\n#### KV Cache effect\n\nSwitching the bundle on or off adds or removes one tool schema in Creator sessions, which changes the cached request prefix of later requests.\n\n## Known Limitations and Deferred Work\n\n<a id=\"known-limitations-and-deferred-work\"></a>\n\n- There is no official market; Discover lists only the index sources the user adds.\n\n-----\n\n<a id=\"dev-note\"></a>\n### Dev Note\n\n<details>\n<summary>Maintainer details — click to expand</summary>\n\nNone.\n\n</details>\n","cordis.patch.yml":"# Custom plugin markets: the Host service that reads the index sources the\n# user configures and the Web Discover tab of the Plugins page. The\n# `plugin_market` tool row in the Creator preset registers its tool only\n# while this service is mounted.\n- insert:\n    - id: plugin-market\n      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-plugin-market'\n      disabled: !!js \"!ctx.get('profileContext')\"\n    - id: ui-plugin-market\n      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-plugin-market'\n","icon.svg":"<svg width=\"36\" height=\"36\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <path d=\"M8 9.5C8 8.67157 8.67157 8 9.5 8H15.5C16.3284 8 17 8.67157 17 9.5V15.5C17 16.3284 16.3284 17 15.5 17H9.5C8.67157 17 8 16.3284 8 15.5V9.5ZM19 9.5C19 8.67157 19.6716 8 20.5 8H26.5C27.3284 8 28 8.67157 28 9.5V15.5C28 16.3284 27.3284 17 26.5 17H20.5C19.6716 17 19 16.3284 19 15.5V9.5ZM8 20.5C8 19.6716 8.67157 19 9.5 19H15.5C16.3284 19 17 19.6716 17 20.5V26.5C17 27.3284 16.3284 28 15.5 28H9.5C8.67157 28 8 27.3284 8 26.5V20.5ZM22.25 19H24.75V22.25H28V24.75H24.75V28H22.25V24.75H19V22.25H22.25V19Z\" fill=\"url(#paint0_linear_plugin_market)\" />\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"paint0_linear_plugin_market\" x1=\"8.5\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"26\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <stop stop-color=\"#67C7FE\" />\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#3F77D8\" />\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n</svg>\n","locale/en.json":"{\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"title\": \"Custom plugin markets\",\n    \"description\": \"Adds a Discover tab to Plugins for browsing and installing bundles from plugin market indexes you add\"\n  }\n}\n","locale/zh.json":"{\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"title\": \"自定义插件市场\",\n    \"description\": \"在插件页添加「发现」标签页，从你添加的插件市场索引浏览和安装插件。\"\n  }\n}\n","package.json":"{\n  \"name\": \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-plugin-market-bundle\",\n  \"description\": \"Experimental custom plugin markets: a Discover tab that browses and installs bundles from plugin market indexes\",\n  \"version\": \"0.2.1-rc.2\",\n  \"icon\": \"./icon.svg\",\n  \"publishConfig\": {\n    \"access\": \"public\"\n  },\n  \"repository\": {\n    \"type\": \"git\",\n    \"url\": \"git+https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness.git\",\n    \"directory\": \"packages/experimental/plugin-market-bundle\"\n  },\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"main\": \"lib/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"lib/types/index.d.ts\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": {\n      \"types\": \"./lib/types/index.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./lib/index.js\"\n    },\n    \"./src/*\": \"./src/*\",\n    \"./package.json\": \"./package.json\",\n    \"./cordis.patch.yml\": \"./cordis.patch.yml\",\n    \"./locale/*.json\": \"./locale/*.json\"\n  },\n  \"files\": [\n    \"icon.svg\",\n    \"locale/*.json\",\n    \"lib/index.js\",\n    \"cordis.patch.yml\",\n    \"lib/types/**/*.d.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-plugin-market\": \"workspace:*\",\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-plugin-market\": \"workspace:*\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"@deepseek-ai/cordis\": \"workspace:~\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@deepseek-ai/cordis\": \"workspace:~\"\n  },\n  \"dsh\": {\n    \"bundle\": {\n      \"patch\": \"./cordis.patch.yml\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n","src/index.ts":"/** Experimental custom plugin market composition; runtime rows live in cordis.patch.yml. */\nexport {}\n","tsconfig.json":"{\n  \"extends\": \"../../../tsconfig.base.json\",\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"rootDir\": \"src\",\n    \"outDir\": \"lib/types\"\n  },\n  \"include\": [\n    \"src\"\n  ],\n  \"references\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"../../../vendor/cordis\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","tsdown.config.ts":"import { defineConfig } from 'tsdown'\n\nexport default defineConfig({ entry: ['lib/types/index.js'], outDir: 'lib', format: ['esm'], platform: 'node', target: 'es2024', fixedExtension: false, dts: false, clean: false })\n"},"symbols":{"defs":[],"files":{},"api":[],"uses":{}}});
